  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: "\u8AB0\u7684\u5F71\u5B50\u6BD4\u8F03\u9577\uFF1Ftext_en"
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7c343185fa3849e498acf1bd58a9152a, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1029341937664
    m_Localized: In the Animomo forest, the giraffe Isbert always managed to easily
      reach the highest point. His friends exclaimed in amazement, "Wow! That popsicle
      is amazing!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1546554146816
    m_Localized: What ability does the giraffe Isbert possess that amazes hs friends?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1642851172352
    m_Localized: Incorrect! Please try again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2366993563648
    m_Localized: Runs faster than other animals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2754782134272
    m_Localized: can reach the highest point
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3021971881984
    m_Localized: can create beautiful shadows
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3098538901504
    m_Localized: You are correct!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3888636723200
    m_Localized: 'A sour feeling welled up inside Orange: "It''s so unfair, why is
      he so tall?" This little monster of "comparison" was quietly growing in her
      heart.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4192321110016
    m_Localized: How did Orange feel when she saw Isbert being praised?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4311061856256
    m_Localized: Incorrect! Please try again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4643091349504
    m_Localized: felt jealous
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5449299492864
    m_Localized: Felt proud
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5569818624000
    m_Localized: Felt inferior
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5655151738880
    m_Localized: You are correct!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6181037768704
    m_Localized: Jimmie whispered, "Even if I jump, I'm only as high as Isbert's
      toes. Will we always be this insignificant?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6572034981888
    m_Localized: his thorns might hurt his friends
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8293343789056
    m_Localized: felt so insignificant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8560944578560
    m_Localized: cannot jump high enough
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8833356234752
    m_Localized: What negative thoughts does Jimmie have about his body?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8960867270656
    m_Localized: Incorrect! Please try again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9045147615232
    m_Localized: You are correct!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9489420877824
    m_Localized: 'As the sun began to set, Isbert suggested, "Let''s go up the hillside
      to watch the sunset!"


      Orange walked dejectedly, completely unaware
      of the change in the ground.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12768297058304
    m_Localized: 'When Isbert suggested going to the hillside to watch the sunset,
      Orange''s state of mind was:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12935440072704
    m_Localized: Incorrect! Please try again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13046995976192
    m_Localized: Running with  enthusiasm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13553646927872
    m_Localized: too tired to hike up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14222848131072
    m_Localized: walking dejectedly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14403979149312
    m_Localized: You are correct!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14576457318400
    m_Localized: '"Oh my god! Who is that?" Orange couldn''t help but exclaim in
      surprise.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 623064925569024
    m_Localized: A gigantic black shadow appeared on the screen. The shadow's legs
      stretched out incredibly long, and when it waved its hand, it seemed as if
      it could touch the distant clouds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 623573459763200
    m_Localized: '"Is that...me?"



      Jimmie discovered that her shadow resembled
      a continuous mountain range, and the thorns had transformed into a giant crown.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 624247299866624
    m_Localized: 'It turns out that advantages aren''t absolute.



      While Isbert
      can see distant clouds, Orange can explore tree hollows, and Jimmi can curl
      up into the warmest ball.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 625783086219264
    m_Localized: What are Orange's unique advantages?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 625882348617728
    m_Localized: Incorrect! Please try again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 626495727828992
    m_Localized: Can explore the tree cave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 626830487814144
    m_Localized: shrink into a warm ball
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 627231672991744
    m_Localized: see the clouds from afar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 627935330402304
    m_Localized: You are correct!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 628150045212672
    m_Localized: "In the world of Animomo, the best friends encounter a common problem
      in growing up\u2014jealousy and comparison. Giraffe Isbert naturally possesses
      an enviable height advantage, always easily reaching for high places. This
      makes the other friends, especially the petite Orange and Jimmie, feel a pang
      of envy and a sense of comparison."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 630339325100032
    m_Localized: Volume
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 630580153647104
    m_Localized: Brightness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 630645349908480
    m_Localized: Text size
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 630694913998848
    m_Localized: Music
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 631218363138048
    m_Localized: Save
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 631408444801024
    m_Localized: Main Menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2471530379313152
    m_Localized: https://chatterbooksapi.dctit.hk/
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8314377384984576
    m_Localized: In the main menu, you can select the book you want to read from
      the catalog.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8314475393286144
    m_Localized: Menu Navigation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8314520716935168
    m_Localized: Book Navigation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8314559375835136
    m_Localized: Minigame Navigation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8315560216461312
    m_Localized: 'When you are on an ebook page, you can use the left and right buttons
      to browse books.

      The book includes interactive elements, including multiple-choice
      questions and scenarios of interaction between parents and children.


      You
      can also use the bookmark button to bookmark pages so that when you return
      to the book later, you can start reading from the page you bookmarked.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8317578968530944
    m_Localized: 'In the matching game, you need to identify a feature and match
      it with the corresponding button.

      For example, if you press a button
      that says "blue", then you need to find and press the button that is blue in
      color.

      If an incorrect pairing occurs, the button and the paired item
      will be highlighted with a red border, allowing you to select and pair again.

      If
      the pairing is correct, the button and the paired item will display a green
      border.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8317746300289024
    m_Localized: 'In the drawing mini-game, you can write on the right and learn
      the strokes of the words shown on the left. (You can press the play button
      to learn the strokes.)

      You can use the reset button to clear the handwriting
      pad and the replay button to replay the text you just wrote.

      You can
      also use the slider below the writing pad to speed up or slow down the font
      reconstruction process.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
